    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Selecting Text-to-Speech**\n\nI've decided on Google Cloud Text-to-Speech for text synthesis. Next, I'll integrate the necessary provider-specific code into `synthesize_text.py` to create the audio byte stream. This means focusing on the API calls for Google's service within the file.\n\n\n**Implementing Google TTS**\n\nI've made progress on `synthesize_text.py`. The initial decision to use Google Cloud Text-to-Speech is firm. I am now focused on integrating the necessary API calls. The plan is to initialize a `client` and call `synthesize_speech` within the Python file.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789861870549,
          "start": 1789861867514
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc14affa001bufV1sSN9qbEMV",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc14aabc0015twb0cHerA5eim",
      "session_id": "ses_f43eb55c6ffeSqISKyzc3RLQWa",
